Subject: [PATCH] video: acknowledge camera DMA stop before releasing owners

Observe channel-local STOP/PARK and reset/FIFO state without polling in IRQ
context. Retain descriptors, queues and callback context on pending abort,
including partial START and automatic STOP failures. A failed consuming close
keeps native owners pinned and refuses reopen. Rust owns retry deadlines.

PARK is descriptor-FSM idle; this does not claim a separately observed external
bus fence or physical cache-off timing qualification.

